Licences for the files in this directory
=======================================

The code in this repository is MIT (see ../LICENSE). The labeled corpus is
licensed separately, so it can be reused as an evaluation set without taking on
a code licence.

dev.json
test.json
--------
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

  "actiongate action-item corpus" by Laksh Goyal, CC BY 4.0.
  Source: https://github.com/lgoyal6/actiongate

16 hand-written labelled meetings, 80 action items. Every meeting is invented;
none is a transcript of a real conversation, and no real person, company or
customer record appears in them. You may copy, redistribute, remix and build on
these files for any purpose, including commercially, provided you give
attribution.

The payload shape follows Circleback's published webhook schema, read
2026-08-14. That schema is Circleback's; the contents of these files are mine.
